# Slow drag: crosses the drag threshold, then settles below the inertia threshold.

output-dir out/scroll_drag_no_inertia_frames
montage out/scroll_drag_no_inertia_montage.bmp
frames 12
step-ms 33
start-ms 1000
viewport 300 300
columns 4
gap 6

event 2 pointer-down 150 142
event 3 pointer-move 150 137
event 4 pointer-move 150 136
event 5 pointer-up 150 136
